rthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c9" target="c10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="Quy tắc: g = δ + c_{k+1}·w/a_{k+1}. Mở rộng khi g &gt; FOPT, cắt khi g ≤ FOPT.&#10;Các vật đã sắp c/a giảm dần: 10/5, 5/3, 3/2, 6/4." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=13;fontFamily=PT Sans;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="340" y="470" width="700" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>